# Xander — who changed what. Newest on top. Every AI that touches him adds an entry and signs it.
# Format:  date  ·  who  ·  what changed (files)  ·  how it was proven

2026-09-13 · Claude Opus 5 (Claude Code) · branch worktree-missions-and-shortcuts
  - xander_agent/composer.py (new) + tui.py: `?` shows the shortcuts card (keys, modes, every registered
    command); `/` shows suggestions ranked by use under the composer, tab completes; usage counts in
    state/composer-usage.json so commands added later appear on their own.
  - xander_agent/policy.py + executor.py: `apt purge x` approved once and run as
    `sudo -n apt-get purge -y x` (the operator sees that form); reading GitHub (gh search/view/list/GET) LOW.
  - xander_agent/engine.py: gear-up step in SET_UP (missing tools installed through the executor before
    the first plan; skill cards read by the coder too); plans that act on files nothing created are
    rejected with the folder's real contents; a plan seen at any earlier attempt is a repeat; ModelPlan
    schema requires actions/acceptance_checks (the 9B build otherwise stopped after the prose); commands
    the order names ("run cargo test") are checks the planner cannot drop; the coder sees the last failed
    check, thinks on a retry, and a cut-off generation is retried then blocked; coder rewrites become
    git-applicable patches (No-newline markers); depends_on labels resolve to the step they name; the
    judge names the failing check and its error line; `xander run --yes` for unattended runs.
  - xander_agent/research.py: an install/remove order gets "how it is installed" evidence (dpkg/snap/pip/flatpak).
  - xander_agent/models.py: `steering` is a valid event type (typing mid-run no longer killed the mission).
  - ASKAR/shared/skills/webassembly-text: the .wat forms, wat2wasm, node loader.
  - ~/SPQR/XanderGrounds cleaned to missions only; `000 - first drills/01..08` with the order and proof
    per subfolder (old contents in ~/SPQR/XanderGrounds.old-2026-09-12).
  Proven by: tests/ 385 passed; drills on qwenpaw: 08 fix-the-bug (2 attempts), 05 wasm (1), 02 read the
  web (6), 03 python snake (1) completed; 04 rust builds+tests, 07 github, 06 own TUI: see .todo.

2026-09-12 · Claude Opus 5 (Claude Code) · branch worktree-discussion-first-commands
  - xander_agent/tui.py rewritten: one feed of selectable Static entries + one composer; no tabs, no
