  - xander_agent/policy.py: workspace-contained touch/mkdir/cp/mv/rm and interpreters running a
    workspace script are MEDIUM, not HIGH; py_compile/unittest LOW; test/sleep/echo read-only.
  - xander_agent/engine.py: quick path; acceptance checks synthesized from the plan instead of a
    3× "no checks" wall; argv-less command steps repaired (deterministic "run X.py", else one
    focused model call with strict validation); identical rewrite = done, not blocked; empty file
    means empty; answers sized to the message; planner told to use installed tools only.
  - xander_agent/intents.py: tight chdir phrase; venting → conversation; everyday verbs authorize.
  - xander_agent/calibers.py + variants.py: one resident heretic model for all roles; heretic and
    uncensored builds pass the local policy; alternatives tried when the main build is absent.
  - xander_agent/arena.py (new) + `xander arena`: written orders in throwaway folders, deterministic
    checks + model judge, report under state/arena/.
  - Root prototype (agent.py … toolbelt.py) moved to _attic/. Xander.MD → .xander (rewritten).
    .folder, .todo, .changes added. Monica/config.py → same heretic model. Six huihui_ai models
    removed from Ollama; qwen3.5-9b-ultra-heretic pulled for comparison.
  Proven by: tests/ 365 passed; arena one-liners 4/4 (judge 10/10); hard scenarios: fizzbuzz, group-by-type,
